  designNotes: 'Target friendly creature is sacrificed (its Last Will happens; a
    Blessing can''t stop it) and rises again at the Dawn 3 Days later, ready, full
    Health. Three days, as the scripture says. Myth''s loophole: its offering pays
    a Necronomicon''s Sacrifice the same Day, one death for both.'
  artDescription: 'Only the feather, watercolour on paper: red at the quill through
    orange to a yellow heart, its barbs licking out like flames, a glowing eye near
    the top, the tip burning out lilac, sparks all round.'
